<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effekten has issued 250,000 range warrants, on the dollar/mark exchange rate, in four tranches, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE DATE   27.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	17.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS, BERLIN, HAMBURG, STUTTGART</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TRANCHE	 RANGE	  PRICE</p>
<p> ONE	     1.67-1.77    4.99 DEM</p>
<p> TWO	     1.65-1.80    4.06 DEM</p>
<p> THREE	   1.66-1.76    2.45 DEM</p>
<p> FOUR	    1.63-1.83    5.51 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   BTWAR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
